# Allow list (NFR-SEC-09, DEC-081): everything is excluded from the Docker build context, then only what the
# images need is added back. Secrets such as .env can therefore never reach an image by accident.
*

!global.json
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Packages.props
!.editorconfig
!src/
!web/admin/
!docker/admin/nginx.conf

# Dependencies and build output of a local build must not override those inside the image.
**/bin/
**/obj/
web/admin/node_modules/
web/admin/dist/
web/admin/.angular/
